{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2012-09", "window": 2, "start_date": 1347062400, "end_date": 1347753599, "month_true_total": 37, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 17:46:38 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "2661623", "author": {"steamid": "76561198010674230", "personaname": "alfief", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/alfief/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 7298, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5464, "last_played": 1675535796, "avatar": "144e4b282e7799698557217046cbe1c6a3ebf3e5"}, "language": "english", "review": "Certainly enjoyed this first person, out-of-series, hack&slash game. I liked the limitation of not having all the weapons available at any time, or the jump packs, in the story mode, but I have to say that like everyone else I enjoyed the online game a lot, even if there is no time for chatting except to \"shout\" your frustration at lacking enough levels to finish the rounds!", "timestamp_created": 1347730205, "timestamp_updated": 1347730205, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "4585898", "author": {"steamid": "76561198039406799", "personaname": "Monkey D Japan", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198039406799/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 711, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 711, "last_played": 1348124400, "avatar": "34f3a5ba57863c74a74cb5dbf499870cbc542ef1"}, "language": "english", "review": "「普通」、「単純」、「ありきたり」と言ったような言葉がピッタリ当てはまるＴＰＳで実際に他にもこういうのはあるよ。結局は好みなんだけど、戦場の真ん中に放り込まれたメカっぽいオッチャン達ｗｗｗがオーク共をバッサバッサと薙ぎ倒していく様が哀愁を漂わせつつ爽快感があって気持ちいい。テンポやストーリーも大事だけどメカっぽいオッチャン達が好きじゃないと（そこかい？！）面白さ半減かなｗ。あまり話題にならない割には面白い良作だと思う。色々と残念な移植なので拘りのある人は回避、もしくはデモるが吉。", "timestamp_created": 1347587223, "timestamp_updated": 1347587223, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "2781524", "author": {"steamid": "76561198012531212", "personaname": "☧ Aqui1ifer", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/aqui1ifer/", "num_games_owned": 309, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 21979, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 10662, "last_played": 1773196393, "avatar": "b5d45abe92363c9cc2bd8f5d697c646c0382f256"}, "language": "english", "review": "Awesome game! So much personalization, challenging multiplayer, lots of variety in games or gamplay, a setting in the 40k universe, where everything is OP: A perfect package to me.", "timestamp_created": 1347536647, "timestamp_updated": 1347536647, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.527559041976928711", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "75897", "author": {"steamid": "76561197961194018", "personaname": "Delta Dagger", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/MiG21bisFishbedL/", "num_games_owned": 794, "num_reviews": 369, "playtime_forever": 1052, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 881, "last_played": 1694481782, "avatar": "731f0553cfaca57f7fe0350f6ef783dd4e399b54"}, "language": "english", "review": "I like this game, but there's a lot wrong with it. For example checkpoint saves. Why? Secondly, random slow down on screen and no FPS drop. Literally, things go slow-mo for no reason at times. And, this problem has existed for a while, too. With QA like this, THQ deserves the slide they're in. The Art department needs a ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ raise and employment else where as they did a fantastic job. In fact, all of Relic did great here, but THQ constraints no doubt put a damper on a lot of the awesome, leaving a great game just being good. \n\nThe biggest and most daming problem is the multiplayer: No ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ dedicated servers? Kiss my ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ ass. Dedicated servers are ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ superior to P2P. Not only that, the game builds up the customization of the player only to LOCK AWAY ALL OF THE ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ CUSTOMIZATION. Almost no one plays online, so when you unlock the Customizer, you have ♥♥♥♥ all save for paint jobs. Unlocks are a fad that needs to ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ go the way of the dodo.", "timestamp_created": 1347513764, "timestamp_updated": 1385423684, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.490688741207122803", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "470670", "author": {"steamid": "76561197970864134", "personaname": "SLoB", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/LF_SLoB/", "num_games_owned": 2164, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 816, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 816, "last_played": 1347174000, "avatar": "40004f439d7ae4b82713232f3d337aade91181af"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great atmosphere :)", "timestamp_created": 1347472482, "timestamp_updated": 1347472482, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam